    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "By studying mage lights (which are nothing more than glowing balls of coalesced mana) and eldritch orbs I have figured out a way to "
        },
        {
          "text": "harden a barrier of pure mana around my target",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ". This will deflect some damage (or all, I imagine if I put enough magnitude into it). However, the cost to my magical fortitude will eventually wear me down. Still, better than being dead. \n\nIf I cast this on another target, it will still use my mana if I am close enough, or the effect will simply end if I am too far away.\n\nThis can only be crafted by those allied with the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Council of Wizards",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    }
